    <node id="Screen">
      <data key="d0">Screen</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Screen artifacts are various web pages and forms within a digital interface, each serving specific functions. The "Shopping Cart" screen artifact, identified by the ID 'cart_empty', is an empty shopping cart page with the title 'Shopping Cart'. This page can be accessed through the URL 'http://localhost:7770/checkout/cart/'. Another screen artifact, labeled 'category', represents the 'Electronics' category listing, accessible via the URL 'http://localhost:7770/electronics.html'. The 'home' screen artifact, titled 'One Stop Market', serves as the store homepage, which can be reached at 'http://localhost:7770/'. Additionally, there is an advanced search form, which allows users to perform detailed searches within the system. A customer login form artifact is also present, enabling users to log in and access their accounts. The 'subcategory' screen artifact, with the ID 'subcategory', is a subcategory under the 'Electronics' category, specifically for 'Cell Phones &amp; Accessories', and can be navigated to through the URL 'http://localhost:7770/cell-phones-accessories.html'. Lastly, the 'register' screen artifact, with the ID 'register', facilitates the creation of a new customer account, with the title 'Create New Customer Account', and is accessible at 'http://localhost:7770/customer/account/create/'.&lt;SEP&gt;Forgot password form&lt;SEP&gt;A screen artifact with ID 'search_results', title "Search results for: 'shirt'", and description "Search results for 'shirt'".&lt;SEP&gt;Screen id='minicart_open', title='One Stop Market', description='Mini-cart dropdown open (after item in cart)', url='http://localhost:7770/'&lt;SEP&gt;A screen with ID 'cart_with_item', title 'Shopping Cart', and description 'Cart after Add to Cart'.&lt;SEP&gt;Guest orders and returns form screen&lt;SEP&gt;Screen artifact with ID 'account_logged_in', title 'My Account', description 'My Account after UI login', URL 'http://localhost:7770/customer/account/'</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-10590a974d11935a433560ab608cc4ab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-18737c929f0e58f64d4f20637bd214c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e655bdbe42e94b57b5af114fcde92d5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-36f6576613a283888b16c8f9146dbd71-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3881dc8d47b3676c7ac00352787e5b11-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98635dbb5321900fe07ed4d39d07cf78-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9e92b01bfe3c2300574d5d397bef740c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bc7fa509f6089f64c49c65f0ceb6b8ff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d2a72d64e9d709b745758f4681df3ca6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e71e082796434ad5e7fdfd56adbca8ef-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-251472ea8351de945743e3a79d872336-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-34a4752269e7cb15e0bdf4bc87ed2fff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6fee16de15adef8f9c158fcdcfc3c3cf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dbbea0d67fc7a8a8d91f72b4050e0de3-chunk-000</data>
