      <data key="d2">The screen has an ID 'search_results'.&lt;SEP&gt;A screen named search_results&lt;SEP&gt;A location where search results are displayed&lt;SEP&gt;[screen_id] instruction click the menu 'Beauty &amp; Personal Care Sports &amp; Outdoors Clothing, Shoes &amp; Jewelry Home &amp; Kitchen Office Products Tools &amp; Home Improvement'&lt;SEP&gt;The search results screen where the menu item is located.&lt;SEP&gt;The search results screen where the combobox is located.&lt;SEP&gt;[search_results] is a screen element displaying search outcomes.</data>
