      <data key="d2">bbox_px refers to the pixel coordinates of a bounding box, which can also be described as bounding box coordinates in pixels or simply bounding box coordinates. This term specifically denotes the position of a bounding box in terms of pixel values, often used in image processing and computer vision tasks. Bounding box coordinates in pixels provide a precise measurement of where a bounding box is located on a pixel grid, facilitating accurate object detection and tracking in digital images. Examples include the pixel coordinates of a button's bounding box, the bounding box coordinates for a general region, and the bounding box coordinates of various menu items such as "Sports &amp; Outdoors" and "Sign-in Link". Additionally, bbox_px can also refer to the pixel coordinates of links and comboboxes, indicating the precise location of these elements within an image. Specifically, bbox_px encompasses the pixel coordinates of the product image container, the pixel coordinates of the menu item 'Beauty &amp; Personal Care', and the bounding box coordinates of the 'Health &amp; Household' menu item. The bounding box coordinates of the link element in pixels are also included in this definition. Examples of bbox_px include the pixel coordinates [500, 181, 711, 234], the pixel coordinates of the bounding box for the menu item 'Sports &amp; Outdoors', the pixel coordinates of the link's bounding box, and the pixel coordinates of the menuitem 'Tools &amp; Home Improvement'. Bounding box coordinates in pixels for specific menu items like 'Electronics', 'Health &amp; Household', and 'Office Products' are also mentioned, along with the general concept of pixel coordinates for bounding boxes. Pixel coordinates for bounding box are also explicitly mentioned.&lt;SEP&gt;Bounding box coordinates in pixels&lt;SEP&gt;Pixel coordinates of the link 'My Wish List'.&lt;SEP&gt;Pixel coordinates of a bounding box&lt;SEP&gt;Bounding box coordinates in pixels.&lt;SEP&gt;Bounding box coordinates of the link</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c9fc9ee30d9a60fd968f838ea162d4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-024b19b8de0d5b640f27f0a312da5ca5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-035e7b9e2f8521711975d04dc94e090f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0b695dbca7b0baea8472f4b9b8c77cc7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b170fd51d9decb5d06c4423362c7e10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1c39a269c840c652393b3da52117ee29-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e69ba803ff29a691deb2111e022bb4d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2264c0cbd93197c10fe0a09fdbcf60f8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-269a8ede147006aea65d5f4620f825e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-323e293277d50c431bbc02b71c78a7a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-336354e68363ca14a619dc9017f3722b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-45c24883b260d58ce196b2bd5813a10a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4674831f2c70bf7fc7e44baad9da1bd2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4cb747e3acc9f125078ffdabdcabbc3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4d2253d679e093ecd355e3b749bc2b59-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-547a6ce3129ff5916eefb35f8a299993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6862f8705f500b582cfb681d1c6febc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6fdf98cdebdbf6d580bc571f0e63d026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79bdc8c15be295419534818b640a1fab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8192fe169bee4a5676a6db5cde9a3209-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c4c0287492ac47c15df9071249fde66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93994d22ad00beec814080e416a51904-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96f37bc024c1dd81bce2be42d32fb9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9cf014a55715838cd2e7be449bd106f3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9ecd5e9d22535ece235c555f4d9df437-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a01aa3869759c0df193b39c39a682dfb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b64b5d11488f01f9fe0fa193ff7147e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d28c12fec97088c620e43fae9ea0396c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d3f210baa22420bda082ab35ed47c513-chun