    <node id="click">
      <data key="d0">click</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Click is an action method where a user performs a specific interaction on a digital interface. It involves pressing down on an element to activate it, such as a button or a link, which is commonly used to select an item on a screen. This action is often associated with the user's intention to perform a task or navigate through a website or application. Click can also be described as the action of pressing down on an element to initiate its function, which is fundamental in user interaction design and web usability. Additionally, click is a method for performing an action, an action performed on a search interface element, and an action verb.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-0b695dbca7b0baea8472f4b9b8c77cc7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b170fd51d9decb5d06c4423362c7e10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4674831f2c70bf7fc7e44baad9da1bd2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8192fe169bee4a5676a6db5cde9a3209-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9cf014a55715838cd2e7be449bd106f3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a01aa3869759c0df193b39c39a682dfb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f9081d114c069483942bd32f623b7876-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fb1d5f2fb2b282b67736d797b15263cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-712115b30aa90cdcf9e36fbce4237ebd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9fe24d26583c5858737b13f669bc8ff1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38f01529d7e4dbc6a24e45769ece8ee-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-aed19f98e30bc8b112d61f39e3e57a4e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bdc77527a3d323bef3bef65914da4898-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed7b0c15cb56893876e96860b8f2ec71-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f4ef414d260df5e8bd4ce0b4592a5685-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8200c68d4f505cf41f0d2848059e57b9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fd70a7452985d465deec3203fe4826a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0348983a29f95be303fe640ac3a3d375-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1d992112b13accee6ac0cf9a96181f84-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3189339ea6f4fc6117aef9fec12e38bd-chunk-000</data>
