    <node id="link">
      <data key="d0">link</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Link, also known as a hyperlink, is a clickable element in a user interface that leads to another page or resource. It serves as a hyperlink or clickable element, facilitating navigation between different web pages or resources. This artifact is designed to connect users to additional content or information, enhancing the interactive experience on websites and digital interfaces.</data>
