    <edge source="screen_id" target="instruction">
      <data key="d7">164.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The entity referred to as "(instruction, screen_id)" involves interacting with various elements on a user interface. The instructions pertain to clicking different components depending on the screen being used. The home screen is mentioned twice, indicating that the instructions apply to actions taken there. One of the instructions involves clicking the "Create an Account" link on the home screen, while another specifies clicking the combobox labeled "Search entire store here..." on the same screen. Additionally, there is an instruction to click the combobox with the screen ID "search_advanced," suggesting a more advanced search functionality. The term "instruction" is also associated with the screen element having the ID "search_empty," which might imply a default or empty state of the search field. Overall, the instructions seem to guide users through navigating and utilizing different search functionalities on the home screen, with some elements being more specific than others.&lt;SEP&gt;Instruction is part of the screen ID&lt;SEP&gt;To perform the action of clicking the menuitem 'Electronics'&lt;SEP&gt;Instruction to click the link&lt;SEP&gt;An instruction to click the menu item&lt;SEP&gt;To perform the action of clicking&lt;SEP&gt;Clicking action on the combobox</data>
      <data key="d9">applies_to,click,contains,follows,related</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-336354e68363ca14a619dc9017f3722b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d3f210baa22420bda082ab35ed47c513-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-12452d2aa4a1f4053eb75846db92c28d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-29be4ff47307e375f775296be1cde294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-31614258e420804fd40acd6947038f2a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9104b63ab39e8f7a3804222796138bfa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a0e31ce440868a3d3601a01f6b1c3088-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c87ec0c898aa8c18b63d3ebadc9a54f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8306c89a6e17662efce0519d4d1ac0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d89c30514b52a7d6ffd6faa7abd1e057-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5eb3679f3090c0f5f21ae588efb7e3e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67ebc805bc05fcb104d97b50eab62a38-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d22e70f9c5950a52be1706e3c49cd064-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2094fe41d80830c88a043060dcfc8cdd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3068692aae07453a7c411514e1ea3811-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-37328452764bee7b0ed4f30f9d666e33-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4057121fe5aecd83bbfcbebfb9b55918-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f5e9a82e4b6711bf6c7c0f95d1c2e44-chunk-000</data>
