    <edge source="screen_id" target="bbox_px">
      <data key="d7">115.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The entity (bbox_px, screen_id) refers to the relationship between bounding box coordinates and a screen ID. This relationship involves performing actions on a screen ID associated with a location in pixel coordinates. The bounding box coordinates interact with a screen element's ID, and vice versa. Specifically, the bounding box pixel coordinates of a textbox labeled 'Price' are linked to the screen it belongs to. Additionally, the screen ID is related to its bounding box pixel coordinates, indicating a reciprocal interaction between the two elements.&lt;SEP&gt;Bounding box is part of the screen ID</data>
      <data key="d9">click,contains,related</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9104b63ab39e8f7a3804222796138bfa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c87ec0c898aa8c18b63d3ebadc9a54f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8306c89a6e17662efce0519d4d1ac0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d89c30514b52a7d6ffd6faa7abd1e057-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5eb3679f3090c0f5f21ae588efb7e3e5-chunk-000</data>
