    <edge source="screen_id" target="name">
      <data key="d7">91.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The entity or relation referred to as "(name, screen_id)" involves actions performed on elements associated with both a name and a screen ID. This interaction can be described as clicking on an element, where the name of a textbox interacts with either its screen element's ID or simply its screen element. The screen element's ID is also shown to interact with the name of a textbox. Additionally, there is a specific mention of a textbox named "Price," which is related to the screen it belongs to. The screen ID itself is also noted to be related to its name. These interactions suggest a dynamic relationship between textual input fields and their corresponding screen elements, emphasizing the importance of both the name and the screen ID in defining the context of the action being performed.&lt;SEP&gt;Name is part of the screen ID</data>
      <data key="d9">click,contains</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-9104b63ab39e8f7a3804222796138bfa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c87ec0c898aa8c18b63d3ebadc9a54f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8306c89a6e17662efce0519d4d1ac0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d89c30514b52a7d6ffd6faa7abd1e057-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5eb3679f3090c0f5f21ae588efb7e3e5-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1787065967</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
