    <edge source="role" target="name">
      <data key="d7">183.0</data>
      <data key="d8">(name, role) refers to the action of clicking, which is a fundamental interaction used to navigate through various sections of a website or application. This action typically involves selecting a menu item or link to access more detailed information or execute a specific function. Examples include clicking a link to explore topics like 'Sports &amp; Outdoors', 'Health &amp; Household', or 'Tools &amp; Home Improvement'. The term 'role' in this context denotes the function or purpose of a menu item, such as how the 'Video Games' menu item aligns with its name. Additionally, clicking a name implies selecting a specific individual or entity, indicating a direct interaction with a person's identity or profile. The descriptions collectively emphasize the act of clicking as a means to perform actions on named elements or roles within a digital interface. The role assigned to the menu item 'Health &amp; Household' is directly related to the name of the menu item itself. The combobox element also has a role assigned to it, and similarly, the role is assigned to the textbox element. These interactions are crucial for user navigation and functionality within digital interfaces. The textbox 'Price' interacts with its role, and the name 'Price' is related to its role as a textbox. The role of the menu item 'Home &amp; Kitchen' is related to its name, and the role of the menu item 'Video Games' is related to its name. The name 'name' has a role, and the menu item name defines the menu item role.&lt;SEP&gt;A role indicating the function of a name.&lt;SEP&gt;The role assigned to the name.&lt;SEP&gt;The role clicking the name.&lt;SEP&gt;The role to click the name&lt;SEP&gt;To perform the action of clicking a menu item</data>
      <data key="d9">Advanced Search,Electronics,assigned_by,assigned_to,click,defines,has_role,is,is related to,refer_to,represents</data>
      <data key="d10">doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4d2253d679e093ecd355e3b749bc2b59-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-547a6ce3129ff5916eefb35f8a299993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96f37bc024c1dd81bce2be42d32fb9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-12452d2aa4a1f4053eb75846db92c28d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-194f81eb3c83c9cefd1db2a27051c77c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b681e6ff218bd5e8ea006e583399b46-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3061faa96c0c7a421b9cb59faaceecfd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56ec189439a015283fccdce67a566f82-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7e6f0b9e982b547cc8a70604b6b807cd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-841245dee9b14e5f30aa2d5301576659-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8cc1a03033af241faefa99ff5ed7f098-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9104b63ab39e8f7a3804222796138bfa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93c0b52f1424d7d36baed79b40514396-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a0e31ce440868a3d3601a01f6b1c3088-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ac63af929d9bcd32b80115e4b7e7f95a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0adcdaadab92923be5fd15b79b93955-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c2d276c0713cf9e96a47308ae621ecf4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c87ec0c898aa8c18b63d3ebadc9a54f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8306c89a6e17662efce0519d4d1ac0c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d89c30514b52a7d6ffd6faa7abd1e057-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ef919e12c5fe348ead5108146f7e4376-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f59e9aad16bd73322b3a8ba0f7834165-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f68acd2c28a4ffc3bf6cf18c20993ac6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5eb3679f3090c0f5f21ae588efb7e3e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-beadc75609261f0ea03542f0dc14b49b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26e09db01a07794a9ce798e10694e907-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-525d140f4619ad4f23c939f8bc69dd07-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67ebc805bc05fcb104d97b50eab62a38-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c4a28d4f02fee136845510f4c0e93d17-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c835846818bcaa064fe5becb24be9fa6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d22e70f9c5950a52be1706e3c49cd064-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eea838816eb1d2adf150f2bc5a9dab02-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2094fe41d80830c88a043060dcfc8cdd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-385fc40248f2f07379e1712028f0604a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4a1792213e425380d77cb4179dec8f31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-51ea3b753089aea48ac556d937bd20bc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ea9507d14398c33e78fda51bc5387b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6ed408f6323ee8fccb1c84a1058ff73b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7af4f21ec3736ca946e6f1a58eb89e14-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7e22b2191319343ea81db7795943a9d2-chunk-000</data>
