    <edge source="role" target="bbox_px">
      <data key="d7">246.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The entity referred to as "(bbox_px, role)" is a role associated with various menu items, including "Sports &amp; Outdoors," "Health &amp; Household," "Tools &amp; Home Improvement," "Video Games," and "Office Products." This role is specifically linked to the bounding box coordinates of the respective menu items and involves performing actions such as clicking, which is directly tied to the pixel coordinates of the menu items. The role is also related to the bounding box coordinates of the menu item "Video Games" and is associated with clicking pixel coordinates. Additionally, the role is assigned to a link when clicked and is related to the bounding box coordinates of the menu item "Office Products." The role of the textbox represents its bounding box coordinates, and the action performed on a location in pixel coordinates is related to this role. The action of clicking a menu item is a fundamental part of this role, as is the interaction between bounding box coordinates and the element's role. The bounding box pixel coordinates of the textbox "Price" are related to its role as a textbox, and the role of the menu item "Home &amp; Kitchen" is related to its bounding box coordinates. The role of the menu item "Video Games" is also related to its pixel coordinates.&lt;SEP&gt;A role indicating the function of pixel coordinates.&lt;SEP&gt;The role assigned to the bounding box.&lt;SEP&gt;The role clicking the bounding box.&lt;SEP&gt;The role to click the bounding box&lt;SEP&gt;The role assigned to the bounding box coordinates.</data>
      <data key="d9">click,coordinates,has_role,is,is related to,related,represents</data>
